# persistent_bench — GlobalARCHeap overhead: 200k fully-audited ARC
# lifecycles (alloc refs=1 → retain refs=2 → release refs=1 → release
# refs=0 → finalize+free), with automatic cycle detection firing every
# 1000 allocations (~200 mark-sweep passes over the live set).
# Measures memory-management cost against the BALANCED numeric_bench
# baseline: per-op overhead must stay in the microsecond range while
# every lifecycle event is hash-chained into the audit log (v0.48.18).
ACTION main()
  CREATE j(NUM) TO 0.
  CREATE s(NUM) TO 0.
  SEASON j < 200000,
    CREATE o(NUM) TO plant_arc_alloc(64).
    CALL plant_arc_retain(o).
    CALL plant_arc_release(o).
    CALL plant_arc_release(o).
    SET s TO s + 1.
    SET j TO j + 1.
  /SEASON.
  SHOW _from_long(s).
/ACTION.
